# Coding Conventions

Full doc: `docs/standards/coding-conventions.md`

- Strict TS — no `any`, no silent `@ts-ignore`
- Functional components; hooks prefixed `use`
- ~150 lines max per component file
- Import order: external → `@/` → relative; use `import type`
- No `useEffect` + `fetch` for server data
- No server data in Zustand
- Named exports for hooks/components

```bash
pnpm exec tsc --noEmit && pnpm lint
```
